-## 1. Executive Summary
-
-**CLINKA** is a full-stack **engineering marketplace** (MVP) that connects:
-
-- **Clients** ΓÇö post construction/engineering projects, hire engineers, manage bids, and (planned) escrow payments.
-- **Engineers** ΓÇö verified civil/architectural professionals who browse projects, submit bids, and deliver work.
-- **Admins** ΓÇö verify engineer credentials and manage the platform (UI exists; backend admin APIs are not implemented yet).
-
-The product is branded **CLINKA** with a modern dark/light UI, bilingual i18n support (English + Arabic keys in codebase), and a **feature-based folder structure** on both frontend and backend.
-
-**Repository layout:**
-
-```
-CLINKA/
-Γö£ΓöÇΓöÇ backend/          # Express 5 + Prisma + PostgreSQL API
-Γö£ΓöÇΓöÇ frontend/         # Next.js 16 App Router + React 19 + Tailwind 4
-Γö£ΓöÇΓöÇ engineering-marketplace-frontend-development/  # Original UI template/reference
-Γö£ΓöÇΓöÇ breif  for programer.pdf                        # Original Arabic MVP brief (PDF)
-Γö£ΓöÇΓöÇ PROJECT_ARCHITECTURE_REVIEW.md                  # Internal architecture notes
-ΓööΓöÇΓöÇ CLINKA_AI_PROJECT_BRIEF.md                      # This file
-```
