+## 12. How to Run Locally
+
+```bash
+# Terminal 1 ΓÇö Backend
+cd backend
+npm install
+npx prisma migrate dev
+npm run dev
+# ΓåÆ http://localhost:5000
+
+# Terminal 2 ΓÇö Frontend
+cd frontend
+npm install
+cp .env.example .env.local   # set NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL
+npm run dev
+# ΓåÆ http://localhost:3000
+```
+
+### Suggested test flow
+
+1. Register as **client** ΓåÆ verify email (check server logs for link if no SMTP).  
+2. Login with OTP (`FIXED_OTP` if set).  
+3. Click **New project** ΓåÆ modal opens ΓåÆ submit project.  
+4. Register **engineer** with document ΓåÆ verify email ΓåÆ admin must set `APPROVED` in DB to appear in directory (until admin API exists).  
+5. Login as engineer ΓåÆ `/projects` ΓåÆ submit bid.  
+6. Login as client ΓåÆ open project ΓåÆ **Accept bid**.
